OL,3,CSir Billy Boston's funeral route
OL,4,Crevealed as town prepares to pay
OL,5,Crespects
OL,7,FThe route for Sir Billy Boston's
OL,8,Ffuneral cortege has been released as
OL,9,FWigan prepares to pay respects to the
OL,10,Frugby legend.
OL,12,FWigan Warriors fans are invited to say
OL,13,Ffarewell to Sir Billy Boston as his
OL,14,Ffuneral will take place at the club's
OL,15,FThe Brick Community Stadium on
OL,16,FThursday 10 September.
OL,18,FSir Billy scored 478 tries in 487
OL,19,Fmatches for Wigan after making the
OL,20,Fswitch from rugby union to league in
OL,21,F1953.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
