OL,3,CSir Billy Boston's funeral route
OL,4,Crevealed as town prepares to pay
OL,5,Crespects
OL,7,FHe scored a total of 571 tries in his
OL,8,Fcareer, making him the second-highest
OL,9,Ftry scorer in rugby league history.
OL,11,FThe legendary rugby league player
OL,12,Fpassed away on 24 August 2026, aged 92.
OL,14,FSupporters are expected to line the
OL,15,Froute of the funeral cortege as it
OL,16,Fpasses through Wigan to pay their
OL,17,Frespects.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
