OL,3,CSir Billy Boston's funeral route
OL,4,Crevealed as town prepares to pay
OL,5,Crespects
OL,7,FThe route begins at The Bold Hotel at
OL,8,F11.20am, before stopping at
OL,9,FHoneysuckle, Wigan Town Hall, The
OL,10,FGriffin, Uncle Joe's and then
OL,11,Fproceeding towards the stadium.
OL,13,FThe West Stand will be open as Sir
OL,14,FBilly makes his final journey down the
OL,15,FStadium Tunnel.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
