OL,3,CSir Billy Boston's funeral route
OL,4,Crevealed as town prepares to pay
OL,5,Crespects
OL,7,FFans who attend the funeral are being
OL,8,Fasked to make a #1 donation in advance
OL,9,Fthrough the club website, with all
OL,10,Fgoing to Wigan & Leigh Hospice in
OL,11,Fmemory of Sir Billy and Lady Joan
OL,12,FBoston.
OL,14,FThe stadium turnstiles will open from
OL,15,F11.15am, the funeral service starts at
OL,16,F12.30pm.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
