OL,5,Crespects
OL,7,FAt the request of the Boston Family,
OL,8,Fanyone in attendance is encouraged to
OL,9,Fwear Traditional Funeral attire, but
OL,10,Fitems of Cherry Red can be worn such
OL,11,Fas scarves, ties and headwear.
